" to the ``I2C_SCL`` / ``I2C_SDA`` pads (``A5`` / ``A4``)."
msgstr ""
"De ``fir``\\ -driver communiceert alleen met de sensor via **I²C 0** — "
"bedraad de module naar de ``I2C_SCL`` / ``I2C_SDA``\\ -pads (\\ ``A5`` / "
"``A4``\\ )."

